OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle appears
OL,4,Ain court after arrest on charge
OL,5,Arelating to child sex abuse material
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe will be subject to home detention
OL,8,Fand electronic monitoring after being
OL,9,Freleased by a US judge on personal
OL,10,Frecognizance, the DoJ and US Attorney's
OL,11,FOffice in Central California say
OL,13,FImages published by news outlets
OL,14,Falongside reports of the 82-year-old's
OL,15,Farrest appear to show him in handcuffs
OL,16,Fsurrounded by FBI personnel
OL,18,FMarkle has previously denied
OL,19,Fallegations of possessing images of
OL,20,Fchild sex abuse, calling the claims
OL,21,F"sick lies"
