OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle appears
OL,4,Ain court after arrest on charge
OL,5,Arelating to child sex abuse material
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe duchess has been estranged from her
OL,8,Ffather since 2018 - in a statement last
OL,9,Fmonth, the wife of Prince Harry said:
OL,10,F"I am deeply distressed... my thoughts
OL,11,Fare with any children who may have been
OL,12,Fharmed"
OL,14,FShe added that she hoped it could be
OL,15,Funderstood why she had largely cut off
OL,16,Fcontact from her father
